onse reaches the user.\\n4. Never terminate the VS Code server, remote agent, unrelated extension hosts,\\n   or every `node`/`codex` process. After reconnection, reopen the Codex sidebar\\n   and confirm that all saved names are listed.\\n\\nThe official Codex CLI command reference for resuming saved chats is at\\n<https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli/reference>.\\ntotal 20\\ndrwx------  2 ubuntu ubuntu 4096 Sep 11 04:56 .\\ndrwxr-x--- 25 ubuntu ubuntu 4096 Sep 11 11:33 ..\\n-rw-------  1 ubuntu ubuntu   81 Sep 11 04:28 authorized_keys\\n-rw-------  1 ubuntu ubuntu  978 Sep 11 04:56 known_hosts\\n-rw-r--r--  1 ubuntu ubuntu  142 Sep 11 04:56 known_hosts.old\\nCould not open a connection to your authentication agent.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a09042-8bf2-7801-bb15-f50948c65005","create_time":1789126700.2975032}}}
